spans.s:
--(कृष्णद्वैपायन) the name of व्यास in the २८थ् Dva1para; also कृष्ण by the sixth अम्श; the अवतार् of the Lord. योगात्म; the son of पराशर;
1: M. १६४. १७; १७१. ६४; २०१. ३१; वा. ६०. ११.
called his son शुक when he renounced the world at an early age;
2: भा.

. १९; १४. 9.
invited for the राजसूय;
3: भा. X. ७४. 7.
came to स्यमन्तपञ्चक to see कृष्ण and left the place;
4: Ib. X. ८४. 3 and ५७.
heard the ब्र्। पुराण from जातु- कर्णि and narrated it to सूत;
5: Br.
